From 0dbe0d04c180aa67d1a47cdb0cd52021198f2f49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Cerda <admin@thewordinbits.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 16:47:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(i18n): protect product name from localization across all
 locales and source files
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

## Problem
'Peripateticware' was being passed through t() as a standalone translatable
key, and every non-English locale file had translated (or mistranslated) it:
- de: 'Peripatetische Ware'
- es: 'Artículos peripatéticos'
- fr: 'Peripatétiqueware' / 'Logiciel Peripatétique'
- ar: 'بيريباتيكووار' (transliteration)
- ja: 'ペリパティックウェア'
- zh: '流动软件'
- it: 'PeripateticoWare' / 'Peripateticaware'
- he: 'פריפטיקוואר'
- tr: 'Peripatetikware'

Also: footer.brand_title and footer.company_name (used in the copyright line
and brand column) were being localized with generic translations like
'Markentitel', 'título de la marca', 'Nome da empresa', '品牌标题', etc.

## Fix — source code (18 files)
- Add frontend/src/constants/brand.ts with PRODUCT_NAME, PRODUCT_TAGLINE,
  PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT, PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT_TAGLINE constants
- Replace all standalone t('landing:peripateticware', 'Peripateticware') and
  equivalent calls with {PRODUCT_NAME} imported from constants/brand
- Replace copyright footer t() calls with PRODUCT_COPYRIGHT_TAGLINE()
- Fix Footer.tsx: brand column heading and copyright line now use PRODUCT_NAME
  directly instead of t('footer.brand_title') / t('footer.company_name')
- Fix dynamic strings: 'Choose Peripateticware' -> `Choose ${PRODUCT_NAME}`

Affected components: SplashScreen, SignUpScreen, Header (x2), Logo,
LandingPage, Footer, dashboards/index (4 occurrences), DashboardShell,
ParentFeaturesPage, PrivacyPage, StudentHowItWorksPage (x2),
TeacherTourPage (x2), TeacherWelcomePage, HomeschoolWelcomePage

## Fix — locale files (21 files)
- Lock 'peripateticware' key to 'Peripateticware' in all 11 locales
  (ar, de, es, fr, he, it, ja, pt-BR, tr, tu, zh) — both root *.json
  and per-locale landing.json files
- Lock footer.brand_title and footer.company_name to 'Peripateticware'
  in all locales (including en where they were placeholder 'brand title')
- Fix ar.json leading-space artifact: ' Peripateticware' -> 'Peripateticware'
- Total: 27 wrong values corrected across 18 locale files in first pass,
  plus 42 footer key corrections across 21 files

## New file
- frontend/src/constants/i18n-do-not-translate.md — documents every category
  of content that must not be translated: product name, legal acronyms
  (FERPA COPPA GDPR CCPA PIPEDA LGPD PDPA SOC2 APP), email addresses,
  external brand names, technical proper nouns. Includes translator
  instructions for Lokalise, DeepL Glossary, and AI pipelines.
